for Vermilion City on Mondays\\nand Fridays!","msg_0255_P01R0101_00009":"Professor Oak: Hello!\\nYou are starting to have the\\fattitude of a Champion, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\rIt’s time for your Pokédex to match\\nwho you are.\\fLet me see your Pokédex for a second.\\rI’ll upgrade your Pokédex with\\nthe National Mode.\\r","msg_0255_P01R0101_00010":"Professor Oak: Hello!\\nYou are starting to have the...\\fattitude of a Champion, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\rIt’s time for your Pokédex to match\\nwho you are.\\fLet me see your Pokédex for a second.\\rI’ll upgrade your Pokédex with\\nthe National Mode.\\r","msg_0255_P01R0101_00011":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Pokédex was upgraded\\nwith the National Mode!","msg_0255_P01R0101_00012":"Professor Oak: It won’t be easy to\\ncomplete the National Pokédex...\\rHowever, I’m sure you will make an\\nhonest attempt on our behalf!\\r","msg_0255_P01R0101_00013":"Oh, time flies!\\rI have a radio show to record\\nat Goldenrod Radio Tower.\\rYou must be heading for Kanto.\\rIf you come near Pallet Town, do drop\\nby my Pokémon Research Lab!\\r","msg_0255_P01R0101_00014":"The S.S. Aqua uses jets to travel.\\nIt skims over water!","msg_0255_P01R0101_00015":"You’ve been to Kanto already?\\rI hear many rare Pokémon live\\nover there.\\rSounds exciting.\\nI’d love to visit!"},"initTriggers":[{"var":"VAR_UNK_411A","value":1,"script":"_EV_scr_seq_P01R0101_002 + 1"}],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_P01R0101_001 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_P01R0101_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_P01R0101_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_P01R0101_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_P01R0101_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_P01R0101_004":4,"obj_P01R0101_seaman_2":0,"obj_P01R0101_ookido":1,"obj_P01R0101_gswoman3":2,"obj_P01R0101_gsboy2":3}}
